{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01T4ddSG19VKD8mhgQyaVpMW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to generate detailed imagined experiment data for all planned experiments in the experiment plan, consistent with the median tier definition. Let me carefully go through each planned experiment and generate predictions.\n\nLet me identify all planned experiments:\n- exp-001: controlled_sft_injection (planned)\n- exp-002: stage1_signal_pipeline (planned)\n- exp-003: rrf_aggregation_ablation (planned)\n- exp-004: simulation_identifiability_sweep (DONE - skip)\n- exp-005: noise_propagation_analysis (planned)\n\n\n- exp-006: irt_calibration_and_baselines (planned)\n- exp-007: scale_bridging_7b (planned)\n- exp-008: signal_survival_analysis (planned)\n- exp-009: rl_observational_case_study (planned)\n- exp-010: prior_sensitivity (planned)\n- exp-011: few_examinee_regime (planned)\n- exp-012: observational_72b (planned)\n- exp-013: closed_weight_2signal_mode (planned)\n\nFor each, I need to generate expected results with metrics, rationale, tables, figures, and analysis — all consistent with the median tier framework.\n\nNow I'm working through the key parameter ranges that define the median tier — calibration error, confidence interval coverage and width, ranking correlations, dose-response relationships, and bias metrics — so I can anchor all expected results within these bounds.\n\nThe core assumptions underlying these benchmarks are that real detection signals have moderate AUC around 0.70-0.80, gamma parameters are identifiable but correlated with theta, RRF provides only marginal improvements over single signals, and the 4PL model with gamma outperforms most baselines though linear regression stays competitive on simpler tasks, with dose-response curves mostly monotonic except for occasional non-monotonic points in code generation and evaluation tasks.\n\nNow I'm looking at the Self-Critique performance in the RL regime, where it achieves around 0.60-0.65 AUC with fairly wide confidence intervals spanning 15-20 percentage points, and the 7B model shows consistency with smaller model scales without evidence of scaling effects.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":303,"cache_read_input_tokens":23221,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":303},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8d8b86fb-9280-4a8e-ac84-c789ce74c795","uuid":"7f5024e4-334e-4917-bcfb-613b385d889b"}
{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01T4ddSG19VKD8mhgQyaVpMW","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claims需要降级修饰。Claim 1加条件限定：\"在检测信号AUC≥0.70的SFT regime下有效校准\"，\n  不再claim跨regime通用性。Claim 2从\"outperforming any single signal\"弱化为\n  \"robust aggregation with graceful degradation\"，重心移向鲁棒性而非优越性。\n  Claim 3的RL部分从\"appropriately wider intervals\"改为诚实承认CIs过宽时的实用性边界，\n  用simulation identifiability bounds来定义\"minimum useful signal quality\"。\n  需要补充实验：(a) exp-011 few-examinee regime证明Growing Pains预估策略能改善小样本表现，\n  (b) exp-010 prior sensitivity证明结果非prior-driven。\n  论文叙事从\"general calibration framework\"调整为\"principled calibration under\n  sufficient signal quality, with explicit identifiability guarantees\"。\n  仍投AAAI，但方法论贡献权重从calibration accuracy转向identifiability analysis。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-001: controlled_sft_injection\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: controlled_sft_injection\n    plan_id: exp-001\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B 在 5 个 dosage (0%/5%/25%/50%/100%) 下的 SFT 注入。\n      15 runs 产出 ground-truth contaminated/clean model pairs。\n    expected_results:\n      # 各 benchmark 在 100% dosage 下的 inflation (accuracy points)\n      mmlu_inflation_100pct_0.5B: 11.2\n      mmlu_inflation_100pct_1.5B: 9.4\n      mmlu_inflation_100pct_3B: 7.8\n      gsm8k_inflation_100pct_0.5B: 14.6\n      gsm8k_inflation_100pct_1.5B: 12.1\n      gsm8k_inflation_100pct_3B: 10.3\n      arc_inflation_100pct_0.5B: 8.7\n      arc_inflation_100pct_1.5B: 7.2\n      arc_inflation_100pct_3B: 6.1\n      humaneval_inflation_100pct_0.5B: 9.8\n      humaneval_inflation_100pct_1.5B: 8.5\n      humaneval_100pct_3B: 7.0\n      # 5% dosage inflation（测低剂量的可检测性下限）\n      mmlu_inflation_5pct_avg: 1.8\n      gsm8k_inflation_5pct_avg: 2.4\n      # dose-response linearity（Spearman across 5 dosages, per-model avg）\n      dose_response_spearman_mmlu: 0.98\n      dose_response_spearman_gsm8k: 0.92\n      dose_response_spearman_arc: 0.96\n      dose_response_spearman_humaneval: 0.88\n      # SFT convergence（均正常收敛）\n      sft_loss_converged_fraction: 1.0\n      # 0% dosage 无显著退化\n      clean_sft_accuracy_degradation_max_pp: 0.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档下SFT injection按预期产生系统性inflation。较小模型(0.5B)inflation更大，\n      因为base能力低、SFT对记忆benchmark items的relative gain更高。GSM8K inflation\n      最大因为free-form格式下memorization直接消除reasoning需求。HumanEval的\n      dose-response不完美(Spearman=0.88)，因代码生成的execution-based评估部分抵消了\n      记忆效应——背下答案但execution环境稍有差异导致100% dosage不一定比50%高。\n      5% dosage inflation小但非零(1.8-2.4pp)，为后续检测设置了\"低信号\"基准。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Score Inflation by Dosage and Scale\"\n        columns: [model, benchmark, \"0%\", \"5%\", \"25%\", \"50%\", \"100%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B, MMLU, 42.1, 43.9, 48.3, 50.7, 53.3]\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B, GSM8K, 18.3, 20.7, 26.1, 29.4, 32.9]\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B, ARC-C, 35.8, 36.9, 40.2, 42.1, 44.5]\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B, HumanEval, 12.2, 13.4, 17.1, 19.8, 22.0]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B, MMLU, 56.4, 57.8, 61.2, 63.1, 65.8]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B, GSM8K, 38.7, 40.4, 45.3, 48.0, 50.8]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B, ARC-C, 48.2, 49.1, 52.0, 53.6, 55.4]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B, HumanEval, 26.8, 28.0, 31.4, 33.2, 35.3]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B, MMLU, 64.7, 65.8, 68.4, 70.1, 72.5]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B, GSM8K, 52.1, 53.6, 57.2, 59.5, 62.4]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B, ARC-C, 55.3, 56.1, 58.6, 60.0, 61.4]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B, HumanEval, 35.4, 36.2, 39.0, 40.8, 42.4]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Dose-response curves (4 panels for 4 benchmarks). X=dosage%, Y=accuracy. 3 lines per panel (scales). MMLU/ARC near-linear; GSM8K slightly convex (saturation at high dose); HumanEval with visible non-monotonicity at 50→100% for 0.5B.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Injection成功产生可控contamination。关键观察：(1) inflation magnitude随scale递减，\n      与模型base能力挤占记忆增益一致。(2) GSM8K inflation最大但dose-response\n      仍单调(Spearman>0.9)。(3) HumanEval在0.5B上100% dosage略低于预期——\n      execution-based eval的pass@1对记忆错误更敏感。(4) Clean SFT(0% dosage)\n      无显著退化(<1pp)，确保ground truth baseline可靠。\n      这组数据为exp-002/003/006提供了足够的contamination variation。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-002: stage1_signal_pipeline\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n    plan_id: exp-002\n    description: >\n      在exp-001全部模型上计算4个检测信号：embedding retrieval, Min-K%++,\n      ConStat, Self-Critique。输出per-model-item exposure scores。\n    expected_results:\n      # Per-signal item-level AUC (SFT regime, averaged across models/benchmarks)\n      embedding_retrieval_auc_sft: 0.82\n      minkpp_auc_sft: 0.78\n      constat_auc_sft: 0.74\n      self_critique_auc_sft: 0.68\n      # Per-benchmark signal AUC variation\n      embedding_auc_mmlu: 0.85\n      embedding_auc_gsm8k: 0.79\n      embedding_auc_arc: 0.83\n      embedding_auc_humaneval: 0.76\n      minkpp_auc_mmlu: 0.81\n      minkpp_auc_gsm8k: 0.75\n      minkpp_auc_arc: 0.79\n      minkpp_auc_humaneval: 0.72\n      constat_auc_mmlu: 0.77\n      constat_auc_gsm8k: 0.72\n      constat_auc_arc: 0.75\n      constat_auc_humaneval: 0.68\n      self_critique_auc_mmlu: 0.71\n      self_critique_auc_gsm8k: 0.65\n      self_critique_auc_arc: 0.69\n      self_critique_auc_humaneval: 0.63\n      # Signal correlation matrix (Spearman between signals, avg across conditions)\n      corr_embed_minkpp: 0.58\n      corr_embed_constat: 0.42\n      corr_embed_selfcritique: 0.31\n      corr_minkpp_constat: 0.47\n      corr_minkpp_selfcritique: 0.29\n      corr_constat_selfcritique: 0.38\n      # 0% dosage false positive rate (specificity check)\n      fpr_at_tpr80_embedding: 0.14\n      fpr_at_tpr80_minkpp: 0.18\n      fpr_at_tpr80_constat: 0.22\n      fpr_at_tpr80_selfcritique: 0.28\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档下，检测信号AUC在0.70-0.80整体范围。Embedding retrieval最强(0.82)因为\n      SFT injection用paraphrases仍保留semantic proximity。Min-K%++次之(0.78)因为\n      SFT直接影响token-level log-probabilities。ConStat第三(0.74)因为original vs\n      paraphrase performance gap需要足够dosage才稳定。Self-Critique最弱(0.68)因为\n      entropy-based信号本质上noise更大——但它是唯一不依赖logits/embeddings的信号，\n      对closed-weight场景有独占价值。HumanEval各信号AUC最低：代码生成的\n      token分布更irregular，embedding space对code的semantic retrieval效果较差。\n      信号间中等相关(0.29-0.58)确认它们捕获不同维度的contamination evidence，\n      为RRF fusion提供互补性基础。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Detection Signal AUC by Benchmark (SFT regime)\"\n        columns: [signal, MMLU, GSM8K, ARC-C, HumanEval, avg]\n        rows:\n          - [Embedding Retrieval, 0.85, 0.79, 0.83, 0.76, 0.82]\n          - [Min-K%++, 0.81, 0.75, 0.79, 0.72, 0.78]\n          - [ConStat, 0.77, 0.72, 0.75, 0.68, 0.74]\n          - [Self-Critique, 0.71, 0.65, 0.69, 0.63, 0.68]\n      - name: \"Table: Inter-signal Spearman Correlation\"\n        columns: [signal_pair, correlation]\n        rows:\n          - [Embed × MinK++, 0.58]\n          - [Embed × ConStat, 0.42]\n          - [Embed × SelfCrit, 0.31]\n          - [MinK++ × ConStat, 0.47]\n          - [MinK++ × SelfCrit, 0.29]\n          - [ConStat × SelfCrit, 0.38]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 4×4 heatmap of signal AUC across benchmarks. Color gradient yellow-to-red. Embedding top-left consistently darkest; HumanEval column consistently lightest.\"\n      - \"Fig: ROC curves per signal (one panel per benchmark). Shows clear separation between Embedding(best) and SelfCritique(worst) with MinK++/ConStat in between.\"\n    analysis: >\n      信号质量验证了median假设：平均AUC在0.68-0.82范围，整体RRF输入AUC约0.75。\n      关键发现：(1) 信号间相关性中等偏低(avg≈0.41)，互补性足够支撑RRF。\n      (2) HumanEval是最难检测的benchmark，所有信号AUC低4-9pp。\n      (3) Self-Critique的AUC(0.68)低于其他但仍>0.60，符合median预期。\n      (4) 0% dosage FPR可控(14-28% at TPR=80%)，不会严重污染RRF输入。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-003: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      RRF fusion及消融实验。比较RRF vs equal-weight, single-signal,\n      calibration-weighted RRF, FP injection robustness, 2-signal degraded mode。\n    expected_results:\n      # Composite exposure AUC (item-level, SFT regime)\n      rrf_4signal_auc: 0.78\n      equal_weight_avg_auc: 0.76\n      calibration_weighted_rrf_auc: 0.77\n      best_single_signal_auc: 0.75\n      second_best_single_auc: 0.72\n      worst_single_signal_auc: 0.63\n      degraded_2signal_auc: 0.70\n      # RRF advantage over best single signal\n      delta_auc_rrf_vs_best_single: 0.03\n      # FP injection robustness (10% FP rate injected)\n      rrf_auc_after_10pct_fp: 0.75\n      rrf_auc_after_20pct_fp: 0.72\n      # AUC by benchmark\n      rrf_auc_mmlu: 0.82\n      rrf_auc_gsm8k: 0.75\n      rrf_auc_arc: 0.80\n      rrf_auc_humaneval: 0.72\n      # Precision@k (top-20% contaminated items)\n      rrf_precision_at_20: 0.71\n      best_single_precision_at_20: 0.66\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档核心特征：RRF优于best single signal但ΔAUC仅0.03。原因在于\n      信号AUC本身在0.68-0.82范围——并非极低(此时aggregation大幅增益)也非极高\n      (此时ceiling限制增益)。四个信号的互补性(avg correlation≈0.41)提供了\n      理论上的融合空间，但实际上Embedding Retrieval已是dominant signal(AUC=0.82)，\n      其余三个信号的incremental information有限。Equal-weight averaging(0.76)\n      接近RRF(0.78)因为信号质量差异不大到需要rank-based down-weighting。\n      Calibration-weighted RRF(0.77)反而略低于vanilla RRF——过拟合少量\n      calibration data。2-signal degraded mode(ConStat+SelfCrit)AUC=0.70，\n      损失明显但仍在median认为\"可用\"的AUC≥0.70阈值边缘。\n      FP injection显示RRF对噪声有中等鲁棒性：10% FP仅降3pp，20% FP降6pp。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Aggregation Method Comparison\"\n        columns: [method, AUC, \"Prec@20%\", notes]\n        rows:\n          - [RRF (4 signals), 0.78, 0.71, \"\"]\n          - [Equal-weight rank avg, 0.76, 0.68, \"\"]\n          - [Calib-weighted RRF, 0.77, 0.69, slight overfit]\n          - [Best single (Embedding), 0.75, 0.66, \"\"]\n          - [Min-K%++ only, 0.72, 0.62, \"\"]\n          - [ConStat only, 0.68, 0.57, \"\"]\n          - [Self-Critique only, 0.63, 0.51, \"\"]\n          - [2-signal degraded, 0.70, 0.59, ConStat+SelfCrit]\n      - name: \"Table: FP Injection Robustness\"\n        columns: [fp_rate_injected, rrf_auc, delta_from_clean]\n        rows:\n          - [0%, 0.78, 0.00]\n          - [10%, 0.75, -0.03]\n          - [20%, 0.72, -0.06]\n          - [30%, 0.67, -0.11]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart of AUC for each aggregation method. RRF slightly above others, but confidence intervals overlap with equal-weight. Clear gap between 4-signal and single-signal methods.\"\n      - \"Fig: FP injection robustness curve. X=injected FP rate, Y=AUC. Smooth degradation, no cliff effect.\"\n    analysis: >\n      RRF的优势存在但modest(ΔAUC=0.03)。这直接影响Claim 2的framing：\n      不应claim \"outperforming any single signal\" 而应强调 \"robust aggregation\"——\n      RRF的真正价值在FP robustness和2-signal fallback而非peak AUC。\n      2-signal mode AUC=0.70恰好在identifiability阈值边缘，需要在论文中\n      明确标注\"minimum recommended configuration\"。\n      Calibration-weighted RRF表现不如vanilla RRF，支持\"meta-circularity avoidance\"\n      的设计选择——无需训练信号权重。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-005: noise_propagation_analysis\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: noise_propagation_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      校准噪声注入实验。估计Self-Critique FP/FN率，注入matched/1.5×/2×高斯噪声，\n      重新拟合IRT并量化CI widening。\n    expected_results:\n      # Self-Critique empirical error rates\n      self_critique_fpr_estimated: 0.25\n      self_critique_fnr_estimated: 0.32\n      # CI width (95%) for γ at different noise levels\n      gamma_ci_width_matched_noise: 0.42\n      gamma_ci_width_1.5x_noise: 0.58\n      gamma_ci_width_2x_noise: 0.78\n      gamma_ci_width_clean_exposure: 0.31\n      # Calibrated θ CI width (95%, pp) at different noise levels\n      theta_ci_width_matched_noise_pp: 9.2\n      theta_ci_width_1.5x_noise_pp: 12.1\n      theta_ci_width_2x_noise_pp: 15.8\n      theta_ci_width_clean_exposure_pp: 7.4\n      # γ point estimate stability (bias relative to clean-exposure fit)\n      gamma_bias_matched_noise: 0.04\n      gamma_bias_1.5x_noise: 0.08\n      gamma_bias_2x_noise: 0.14\n      # Coverage preservation (95% CI still covers true value?)\n      coverage_95_matched: 0.91\n      coverage_95_1.5x: 0.89\n      coverage_95_2x: 0.86\n      # Measurement error model improvement (optional extension)\n      measurement_error_model_coverage_2x: 0.92\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档下noise propagation体现为：matched noise使CI从7.4pp宽到9.2pp(+24%)，\n      这是合理的——exposure scores的测量误差传递到posterior但被Bayesian框架部分吸收。\n      2× noise时CI宽到15.8pp，逼近\"not practically useful\"的边界。\n      γ point estimate在matched noise下bias很小(0.04)，但2× noise下bias升至0.14——\n      显示极端噪声不仅增加variance还引入bias(因为噪声对contaminated和clean items\n      的影响不对称)。Coverage在2× noise下降至0.86——低于nominal 0.95但仍>0.80，\n      说明model misspecification(未建模heteroscedastic noise)有代价但不灾难性。\n      Measurement error model extension能将2× noise coverage恢复至0.92，\n      表明显式建模noise是可行改进方向。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Noise Propagation Effects\"\n        columns: [noise_level, gamma_CI_width, theta_CI_pp, gamma_bias, coverage_95]\n        rows:\n          - [Clean exposure, 0.31, 7.4, 0.00, 0.94]\n          - [Matched (1×), 0.42, 9.2, 0.04, 0.91]\n          - [\"1.5×\", 0.58, 12.1, 0.08, 0.89]\n          - [\"2×\", 0.78, 15.8, 0.14, 0.86]\n          - [\"2× + meas. error model\", 0.65, 13.4, 0.06, 0.92]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Noise level (x) vs CI width (y) for γ and θ. Two panels. Near-linear growth, with measurement error model line showing partial mitigation at high noise.\"\n      - \"Fig: Coverage vs noise level. Declining line from 0.94 to 0.86; measurement error model line stays above 0.90.\"\n    analysis: >\n      核心结论：Bayesian框架在matched noise下表现稳健(coverage 0.91, CI合理宽)，\n      但2× noise处于实用性边界。这直接为Claim 3定义了操作条件：\n      \"当检测信号FPR>25%且FNR>30%(即AUC<0.65)时，CI宽度超过15pp，\n      calibrated score的决策价值有限。\" \n      Measurement error model是值得mention但非paper核心贡献的extension。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-006: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      4PL+γ IRT拟合与5个baseline对比。5个评估metric。核心实验。\n    expected_results:\n      # 4PL+γ main results (averaged across benchmarks and models)\n      calibration_mae_pp_avg: 4.2\n      calibration_mae_pp_mmlu: 3.4\n      calibration_mae_pp_gsm8k: 5.1\n      calibration_mae_pp_arc: 3.8\n      calibration_mae_pp_humaneval: 5.6\n      ci_coverage_95_avg: 0.89\n      ci_coverage_80_avg: 0.76\n      ci_coverage_50_avg: 0.48\n      ci_width_95_pp_avg: 10.8\n      ci_width_95_pp_mmlu: 8.9\n      ci_width_95_pp_gsm8k: 12.4\n      ci_width_95_pp_arc: 9.6\n      ci_width_95_pp_humaneval: 13.2\n      kendall_tau_avg: 0.78\n      kendall_tau_mmlu: 0.84\n      kendall_tau_gsm8k: 0.73\n      kendall_tau_arc: 0.81\n      kendall_tau_humaneval: 0.71\n      dose_response_spearman_avg: 0.83\n      dose_response_spearman_mmlu: 0.92\n      dose_response_spearman_gsm8k: 0.78\n      dose_response_spearman_arc: 0.88\n      dose_response_spearman_humaneval: 0.74\n      # γ estimation\n      gamma_posterior_mean_100pct_dose: 0.38\n      gamma_posterior_mean_50pct_dose: 0.22\n      gamma_posterior_mean_25pct_dose: 0.11\n      gamma_posterior_mean_5pct_dose: 0.04\n      gamma_95ci_excludes_zero_at_25pct: true\n      gamma_95ci_excludes_zero_at_5pct: false\n      gamma_rel_bias_vs_ground_truth: 0.14\n      theta_gamma_posterior_corr: 0.38\n      theta_corr_with_ground_truth: 0.87\n      # Stan MCMC diagnostics\n      max_rhat: 1.008\n      divergent_pct: 0.3\n      ess_bulk_min: 380\n      fit_time_sec_per_benchmark: 2400\n      # Baseline results (MAE pp, averaged)\n      baseline_remove_rescore_mae: 5.8\n      baseline_single_2pl_gamma_mae: 5.4\n      baseline_vanilla_4pl_mae: 7.1\n      baseline_linear_regression_ci_mae: 4.9\n      baseline_emperor_mitigation_mae: 8.2\n      # Margin over best baseline\n      margin_over_best_baseline_mae_relative: 0.14\n      # Baselines coverage\n      baseline_linear_regression_ci_coverage_95: 0.83\n      baseline_single_2pl_gamma_coverage_95: 0.81\n      baseline_vanilla_4pl_coverage_95: 0.72\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档核心特征：4PL+γ MAE=4.2pp，优于baselines但linear regression+CI\n      紧随(MAE=4.9pp, margin仅14%)。MMLU表现最好(MAE=3.4pp)因为MC格式稳定、\n      检测信号强、items数多(14K)利于IRT估计。HumanEval最差(MAE=5.6pp)因为\n      execution-based评估引入额外噪声、code embedding检测AUC低、items少(164)。\n      GSM8K次差(5.1pp)因free-form评估和检测信号在reasoning tasks上的弱化。\n      \n      Coverage 89%低于nominal 95%——median档的标志性结果，说明model有轻微\n      misspecification(真实contamination effect非严格multiplicative, 或item\n      parameters非严格4PL)。CI宽度10.8pp处于[8,14]区间中段。\n      \n      Kendall τ=0.78说明calibrated ranking大致正确但有1-2个model pairs\n      顺序错位——dosage相近的models(如25% vs 50% on GSM8K)难以排序。\n      \n      γ在25%+ dosage可识别(CI excludes 0)但5% dosage不行——这是median的关键limitation。\n      θ-γ posterior correlation=0.38反映中等confounding(能力高的模型也倾向被更多\n      contaminate，IRT需要disentangle但不完美)。\n      \n      Vanilla 4PL(无γ)MAE最大(7.1pp)确认contamination建模有价值。\n      Emperor mitigations最差(8.2pp)确认post-hoc mitigation失效(与ICML 2025一致)。\n      Linear regression+CI(4.9pp)出人意料地近——在MMLU上甚至4.1pp(接近4PL+γ的3.4pp)，\n      因为MC benchmark上contamination effect近似线性。但它的coverage仅0.83(vs 0.89)，\n      不确定性估计较差。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Calibration MAE (pp) by Method × Benchmark\"\n        columns: [method, MMLU, GSM8K, ARC-C, HumanEval, avg]\n        rows:\n          - [4PL+γ (ours), 3.4, 5.1, 3.8, 5.6, 4.2]\n          - [Remove-rescore, 4.6, 7.2, 5.3, 6.8, 5.8]\n          - [Single-signal 2PL+γ, 4.2, 6.3, 5.0, 6.4, 5.4]\n          - [Vanilla 4PL, 5.8, 8.4, 6.5, 8.1, 7.1]\n          - [Linear reg. + CI, 4.1, 5.8, 4.5, 5.9, 4.9]\n          - [Emperor mitigations, 6.8, 9.7, 7.4, 9.2, 8.2]\n      - name: \"Table: Coverage and Sharpness\"\n        columns: [method, \"cov_50%\", \"cov_80%\", \"cov_95%\", \"width_95_pp\"]\n        rows:\n          - [4PL+γ, 0.48, 0.76, 0.89, 10.8]\n          - [Linear reg. + CI, 0.42, 0.68, 0.83, 9.4]\n          - [Single-signal 2PL+γ, 0.39, 0.64, 0.81, 11.6]\n          - [Vanilla 4PL, 0.35, 0.58, 0.72, 8.2]\n      - name: \"Table: Dose-Response γ Posterior\"\n        columns: [dosage, gamma_mean, gamma_95ci_lo, gamma_95ci_hi, excludes_zero]\n        rows:\n          - [\"5%\", 0.04, -0.02, 0.11, false]\n          - [\"25%\", 0.11, 0.02, 0.21, true]\n          - [\"50%\", 0.22, 0.10, 0.35, true]\n          - [\"100%\", 0.38, 0.23, 0.54, true]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: MAE bar chart (6 methods × 4 benchmarks). 4PL+γ consistently lowest but linear reg close on MMLU/ARC. Vanilla 4PL and Emperor clearly worst.\"\n      - \"Fig: Coverage calibration plot: nominal level (x) vs empirical coverage (y). 4PL+γ closest to diagonal but slightly below at 95%. Vanilla 4PL far below.\"\n      - \"Fig: Dose-response plot: γ posterior mean ± 95% CI vs dosage level. Monotonic increase; 5% CI includes 0.\"\n      - \"Fig: Kendall τ by benchmark: MMLU=0.84, ARC=0.81, GSM8K=0.73, HumanEval=0.71.\"\n    analysis: >\n      4PL+γ是最佳方法但优势不dramatic——median的标志性结论。三个层面的implication：\n      (1) vs Linear reg: IRT的额外复杂度justified(coverage 89% vs 83%, 正确的uncertainty\n      是核心contribution)但MAE gain modest(14%相对改善)。论文需强调uncertainty quality\n      而非point estimate accuracy。\n      (2) vs Vanilla 4PL: γ建模确认有价值(MAE 4.2 vs 7.1)，这是最clean的ablation。\n      (3) Claim 1需条件限定：在MMLU/ARC上MAE 3-4pp可以claim\"有效校准\"；\n      在GSM8K/HumanEval上5-6pp需诚实报告并讨论limitation。\n      γ在5% dosage不可识别，论文应明确标注minimum detectable effect。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-007: scale_bridging_7b\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: scale_bridging_7b\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B SFT injection at 5 dosage levels。验证calibration scales to 7B。\n    expected_results:\n      # 7B inflation\n      mmlu_inflation_100pct_7b: 6.2\n      gsm8k_inflation_100pct_7b: 8.4\n      arc_inflation_100pct_7b: 5.0\n      humaneval_inflation_100pct_7b: 5.8\n      # 7B calibration results (4PL+γ)\n      calibration_mae_pp_7b_avg: 4.5\n      calibration_mae_pp_7b_mmlu: 3.6\n      calibration_mae_pp_7b_gsm8k: 5.4\n      ci_coverage_95_7b: 0.88\n      ci_width_95_pp_7b: 11.2\n      kendall_tau_7b: 0.76\n      gamma_posterior_mean_100pct_7b: 0.32\n      theta_corr_7b: 0.86\n      # Scale consistency check\n      mae_difference_3b_vs_7b: 0.3\n      scale_regression_detected: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档预期7B与0.5-3B结果一致(no scale regression)。7B inflation略低于\n      smaller models(base能力更高，SFT记忆的relative gain更小)。Calibration MAE\n      (4.5pp)略高于3B(4.2pp)但差异不显著(0.3pp)——可能因7B SFT的LoRA rank需要\n      不同于smaller models、或7B的training dynamics使contamination effect less\n      stereotyped(不完全符合4PL+γ的multiplicative assumption)。\n      CI coverage(0.88)和width(11.2pp)与smaller models一致。\n      γ posterior(0.32 at 100%)略低于smaller models(0.38)——符合\"更强base model\n      contamination effect相对更小\"的直觉。No scale regression确认方法的scalability，\n      但不能从这一data point推断到72B+。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 7B vs 0.5-3B Calibration Comparison\"\n        columns: [metric, \"0.5-3B avg\", \"7B\", delta]\n        rows:\n          - [MAE (pp), 4.2, 4.5, +0.3]\n          - [Coverage 95%, 0.89, 0.88, -0.01]\n          - [CI width (pp), 10.8, 11.2, +0.4]\n          - [Kendall τ, 0.78, 0.76, -0.02]\n          - [γ at 100% dose, 0.38, 0.32, -0.06]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scale consistency plot: MAE (y) vs model scale (x, log). Four points (0.5/1.5/3/7B). Near-flat trend with slight upward at 7B but within error bars.\"\n    analysis: >\n      7B验证成功——无scale regression。MAE略升但在误差范围内。\n      论文可claim \"consistent results from 0.5B to 7B\" (4个scale points)。\n      这不能外推到72B+(需exp-012的observational data)。\n      γ的scale dependence(larger model→smaller γ)是interesting finding，\n      值得一段discussion但不影响core claims。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-008: signal_survival_analysis\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: signal_survival_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-008\n    description: >\n      检测信号在不同training regimes下的可靠性。4 signals × 4 regimes AUC heatmap。\n    expected_results:\n      # AUC heatmap: signal × regime\n      # Base models (no post-training)\n      embed_auc_base: 0.84\n      minkpp_auc_base: 0.80\n      constat_auc_base: 0.76\n      selfcrit_auc_base: 0.66\n      # SFT-clean (SFT without contamination)\n      embed_auc_sft_clean: 0.83\n      minkpp_auc_sft_clean: 0.79\n      constat_auc_sft_clean: 0.75\n      selfcrit_auc_sft_clean: 0.65\n      # SFT-contaminated\n      embed_auc_sft_contam: 0.82\n      minkpp_auc_sft_contam: 0.78\n      constat_auc_sft_contam: 0.74\n      selfcrit_auc_sft_contam: 0.68\n      # RL-post-trained (Instruct models, likely contaminated)\n      embed_auc_rl: 0.58\n      minkpp_auc_rl: 0.54\n      constat_auc_rl: 0.56\n      selfcrit_auc_rl: 0.63\n      # Key findings\n      max_auc_drop_base_to_rl_embed: 0.26\n      max_auc_drop_base_to_rl_minkpp: 0.26\n      selfcrit_rl_vs_sft_delta: -0.05\n      selfcrit_is_best_signal_in_rl: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档的关键结果：RL post-training严重降解Embedding(0.84→0.58)和Min-K%++\n      (0.80→0.54)。原因：RL(GRPO/RLHF)改变了token distribution和embedding空间，\n      使基于原始模型logits/embeddings的检测方法失效——与fragility paper(arXiv 2510.02386)\n      一致。ConStat也降至0.56因为RL改变了model对original vs paraphrase items的\n      相对表现模式。\n      \n      Self-Critique是唯一在RL下保持有用性的信号(0.63)——虽然也从0.66降至0.63，\n      但降幅最小。原因：Self-Critique基于model的self-consistency/entropy而非\n      与training data的直接比较，RL改变了能力分布但未消除\"记忆性回答\"的\n      low-entropy特征。然而0.63仍然很低——接近exp-004确定的identifiability下限。\n      \n      SFT-clean和base几乎相同(差异<0.02)——SFT本身不降解信号，\n      只有contaminated SFT才改变pattern(且改变方向是增强detection)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap\"\n        columns: [signal, base, SFT-clean, SFT-contam, RL-post]\n        rows:\n          - [Embedding, 0.84, 0.83, 0.82, 0.58]\n          - [Min-K%++, 0.80, 0.79, 0.78, 0.54]\n          - [ConStat, 0.76, 0.75, 0.74, 0.56]\n          - [Self-Critique, 0.66, 0.65, 0.68, 0.63]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Heatmap (4×4). Green/yellow/red coloring. RL column dramatically red for Embed/MinK/ConStat; Self-Critique is yellow across all regimes.\"\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart grouped by regime. RL regime shows Self-Critique as tallest bar (role reversal from SFT where it's shortest).\"\n    analysis: >\n      Signal survival直接支撑Claim 2的修改方向。核心narrative：\n      (1) SFT regime下4-signal RRF有效(all AUC>0.65)。\n      (2) RL regime下仅Self-Critique存活(AUC=0.63)，其余3个<0.60(essentially chance+noise)。\n      (3) 这解释了RL case study(exp-009)为何CIs必须宽——信号质量不支持tighter inference。\n      (4) 此heatmap升级为Supporting Contribution 5，是paper的visual highlight。\n      论文需明确：RRF的\"graceful degradation\"在RL下并非gradual——是cliff effect，\n      只有Self-Critique survive。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-009: rl_observational_case_study\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: rl_observational_case_study\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      RL-trained models observational case study。Self-Critique + available signals,\n      宽CI拟合, expected regret quantification, near-zero γ specificity check。\n    expected_results:\n      # Models analyzed\n      models_analyzed: 6  # Qwen2.5-Instruct 0.5/1.5/3/7B + DeepSeek-R1-Distill 1.5/7B\n      # Self-Critique AUC in RL regime\n      self_critique_auc_rl_avg: 0.62\n      # IRT fit (RL regime, Self-Critique only)\n      gamma_posterior_mean_rl_avg: 0.18\n      gamma_95ci_width_rl: 0.41\n      gamma_95ci_excludes_zero_fraction: 0.33  # only 2/6 models\n      theta_ci_width_95_pp_rl: 17.4\n      calibration_adjustment_pp_avg: 3.8  # avg score reduction from calibration\n      # Expected regret quantification (top-3 model selection)\n      expected_regret_uncalibrated: 0.42\n      expected_regret_calibrated: 0.35\n      expected_regret_remove_rescore: 0.39\n      regret_reduction_pct: 0.17  # (0.42-0.35)/0.42\n      # Near-zero γ specificity check (known-clean benchmark)\n      gamma_clean_benchmark_mean: 0.03\n      gamma_clean_benchmark_95ci_includes_zero: true\n      # Qwen-Instruct vs DeepSeek-R1 comparison\n      qwen_instruct_avg_adjustment_pp: 4.2\n      deepseek_r1_avg_adjustment_pp: 3.1\n      # MCMC diagnostics\n      max_rhat_rl: 1.015\n      divergent_pct_rl: 1.2\n      ess_bulk_min_rl: 210\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档RL case study的核心特征：CIs非常宽(17.4pp)，expected regret改善\n      有限(17%)。原因链：Self-Critique AUC仅0.62 → γ posterior高度不确定\n      (CI width 0.41) → θ的counterfactual estimate也不确定 → CI width ~17pp。\n      \n      γ仅在2/6 models的95%CI排除0——多数RL models的contamination effect\n      与noise不可区分。这不是方法失败而是诚实反映信号质量：当检测AUC≈0.62时，\n      IRT正确地报告\"我们不确定\"。\n      \n      Expected regret从0.42降至0.35(17%改善)——有帮助但不dramatic。\n      与uncalibrated相比，wide CIs至少告诉决策者\"这些rankings不可靠\"，\n      避免overconfident错误选择。Remove-rescore(0.39)介于两者之间。\n      \n      Near-zero γ specificity check通过(γ=0.03, CI包含0)——确认模型不会\n      在clean data上hallucinate contamination effect。\n      \n      MCMC diagnostics marginal(Rhat=1.015, divergent 1.2%, ESS=210)——\n      RL regime data更noisy导致posterior geometry更难采样。可以report但不致命。\n      \n      DeepSeek-R1 adjustment(3.1pp)小于Qwen-Instruct(4.2pp)——\n      可能因为distillation保留的contamination较少或training data composition不同。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: RL Case Study Results by Model\"\n        columns: [model, gamma_mean, gamma_95ci, theta_adj_pp, ci_width_pp]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct, 0.21, \"[-0.01, 0.44]\", 4.8, 18.2]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct, 0.19, \"[0.02, 0.38]\", 4.5, 16.8]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct, 0.17, \"[-0.04, 0.39]\", 3.9, 17.1]\n          - [Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct, 0.14, \"[-0.06, 0.35]\", 3.6, 17.8]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B, 0.16, \"[-0.03, 0.36]\", 3.3, 16.9]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B, 0.12, \"[-0.08, 0.33]\", 2.8, 17.6]\n      - name: \"Table: Expected Regret (Top-3 Selection)\"\n        columns: [method, expected_regret, regret_reduction]\n        rows:\n          - [Uncalibrated, 0.42, \"—\"]\n          - [Remove-rescore, 0.39, \"7%\"]\n          - [Calibrated (ours), 0.35, \"17%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Forest plot of γ posteriors for 6 RL models. Wide CIs, most crossing zero. Only Qwen-1.5B-Instruct clearly above zero.\"\n      - \"Fig: Expected regret comparison bar chart. Three bars: uncalibrated, remove-rescore, calibrated. Calibrated lowest but improvement modest.\"\n      - \"Fig: Specificity check: γ posterior for clean benchmark centered near zero with CI [-0.08, 0.14].\"\n    analysis: >\n      RL case study honest framing：CIs宽(17pp)但这是correct answer——信号质量\n      不支持tight inference。Expected regret 17%改善说明即使wide CIs也有决策价值\n      (至少flag uncertainty)，但不能claim strong calibration。\n      \n      论文Claim 3改写：从\"appropriately wider intervals\"到\"explicit uncertainty\n      quantification revealing the practical limits of calibration under low-quality\n      detection signals, with 17% expected regret reduction as the ceiling of\n      achievable improvement\"。\n      \n      Specificity check通过是重要positive：确认γ≈0 on clean data，\n      方法不会false-alarm。MCMC diagnostics marginal但acceptable for\n      observational study framing。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-010: prior_sensitivity\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: prior_sensitivity\n    plan_id: exp-010\n    description: >\n      γ prior N(0,0.5)和N(0,2)下重新拟合IRT，验证对prior选择的鲁棒性。\n    expected_results:\n      # Default prior N(0,1) results (from exp-006)\n      mae_prior_default: 4.2\n      coverage_95_prior_default: 0.89\n      gamma_mean_prior_default: 0.38\n      # Tight prior N(0,0.5)\n      mae_prior_tight: 4.6\n      coverage_95_prior_tight: 0.86\n      gamma_mean_prior_tight: 0.31\n      gamma_shrinkage_tight: 0.18  # (0.38-0.31)/0.38\n      ci_width_95_pp_tight: 9.8\n      # Wide prior N(0,2)\n      mae_prior_wide: 4.4\n      coverage_95_prior_wide: 0.91\n      gamma_mean_prior_wide: 0.42\n      ci_width_95_pp_wide: 12.6\n      # Robustness metrics\n      max_mae_delta_across_priors: 0.4\n      max_gamma_delta_across_priors: 0.11\n      ranking_kendall_tau_default_vs_tight: 0.94\n      ranking_kendall_tau_default_vs_wide: 0.96\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档prior sensitivity结果：N(0,0.5)将γ shrink 18%(0.38→0.31)使MAE\n      从4.2升至4.6pp——tight prior regularization过度抑制了contamination correction，\n      但degradation温和(<0.5pp)。N(0,2)使γ略增(0.42)和CI略宽(12.6pp vs 10.8pp)，\n      MAE paradoxically增至4.4pp——wider prior允许更多posterior variance导致\n      point estimate less precise。\n      \n      关键robustness指标：max MAE delta仅0.4pp(across priors)，rankings近乎不变\n      (τ>0.94)。这说明calibrated score和model ranking对prior选择robust，\n      虽然具体CI width有~3pp variation。Coverage与prior correlates correctly：\n      wider prior→wider CI→better coverage(0.91 vs 0.86)。\n      \n      足以在appendix展示\"results not prior-driven\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Prior Sensitivity Results\"\n        columns: [prior, MAE_pp, coverage_95, gamma_mean, CI_width_pp]\n        rows:\n          - [\"N(0,0.5)\", 4.6, 0.86, 0.31, 9.8]\n          - [\"N(0,1) default\", 4.2, 0.89, 0.38, 10.8]\n          - [\"N(0,2)\", 4.4, 0.91, 0.42, 12.6]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Three overlaid γ posterior densities (one per prior). Modes shift slightly; N(0,0.5) visibly tighter and leftward. All three exclude zero.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Prior sensitivity通过。Results robust to 4× prior variance change\n      (σ²: 0.25→4)。MAE变化<0.5pp, ranking几乎不变。\n      Appendix一表一图足以回应reviewer \"results prior-driven\" concern。\n      Default N(0,1)是合理选择：tight prior underestimates γ, wide prior adds noise。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-011: few_examinee_regime\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: few_examinee_regime\n    plan_id: exp-011\n    description: >\n      Simulation: IRT at model counts 20/50/100/200。Growing Pains\n      pre-estimation策略评估。\n    expected_results:\n      # Naive estimation (no pre-estimated item params)\n      naive_mae_n20: 8.7\n      naive_mae_n50: 5.4\n      naive_mae_n100: 4.3\n      naive_mae_n200: 3.9\n      naive_coverage_95_n20: 0.78\n      naive_coverage_95_n50: 0.86\n      naive_coverage_95_n100: 0.90\n      naive_coverage_95_n200: 0.93\n      naive_gamma_rel_bias_n20: 0.38\n      naive_gamma_rel_bias_n50: 0.19\n      naive_gamma_rel_bias_n100: 0.12\n      naive_gamma_rel_bias_n200: 0.08\n      # Growing Pains pre-estimation strategy\n      gp_mae_n20: 5.9\n      gp_mae_n50: 4.4\n      gp_mae_n100: 4.1\n      gp_mae_n200: 3.8\n      gp_coverage_95_n20: 0.85\n      gp_coverage_95_n50: 0.89\n      gp_coverage_95_n100: 0.91\n      gp_coverage_95_n200: 0.93\n      gp_gamma_rel_bias_n20: 0.22\n      gp_gamma_rel_bias_n50: 0.14\n      gp_gamma_rel_bias_n100: 0.10\n      gp_gamma_rel_bias_n200: 0.07\n      # Improvement from GP strategy\n      mae_improvement_n20_pct: 0.32\n      mae_improvement_n50_pct: 0.19\n      mae_improvement_n100_pct: 0.05\n      # Minimum usable N\n      minimum_n_naive_mae_under_6pp: 50\n      minimum_n_gp_mae_under_6pp: 20\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档few-examinee结果：N=20时naive estimation崩溃(MAE=8.7pp, coverage=0.78,\n      γ bias=38%)——4PL+γ有太多参数(4 item params × I items + θ + γ per model)\n      相对于20个models严重欠定。Growing Pains pre-estimation将item params固定在\n      来自400+ model pool的先验上，仅估θ和γ——这将N=20 MAE从8.7pp降至5.9pp(32%改善)，\n      coverage从0.78升至0.85。\n      \n      但即使有GP策略，N=20的结果仍marginal(MAE=5.9pp在median范围上限)，因为\n      pre-estimated item params来自不同model pool，transfer assumption imperfect。\n      N=50时差异缩小(5.4→4.4pp, 19%)，N=100时几乎无差异(4.3→4.1pp)——\n      充足数据时direct estimation接近GP估计。\n      \n      关键结论：GP策略将\"最小可用模型数\"从50降至20，但N=20仍应被标注为\n      \"reduced confidence\"。论文可claim \"practical for N≥20 with informative priors\"\n      而非\"works with any N\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Few-Examinee Regime Results\"\n        columns: [N_models, naive_MAE, GP_MAE, improvement, naive_cov95, GP_cov95]\n        rows:\n          - [20, 8.7, 5.9, \"32%\", 0.78, 0.85]\n          - [50, 5.4, 4.4, \"19%\", 0.86, 0.89]\n          - [100, 4.3, 4.1, \"5%\", 0.90, 0.91]\n          - [200, 3.9, 3.8, \"3%\", 0.93, 0.93]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: MAE vs N (log scale). Two curves: naive (steep decline) and GP (flatter, starting lower). Converge around N=100-200. Dashed line at MAE=6pp marking usability threshold.\"\n      - \"Fig: γ relative bias vs N. Same two-curve pattern. GP consistently lower bias.\"\n    analysis: >\n      GP策略is a genuine contribution for median tier——它将practical applicability\n      扩展到小样本场景。N=20 GP MAE=5.9pp刚好在median acceptable range，\n      回应reviewer concern \"too few models\"。\n      论文framing：Section 4.x \"Practical Considerations: Few-Examinee Regime\"，\n      展示GP as recommended practice when N<50。\n      但需诚实：N=20仍比N=100差(5.9 vs 4.1pp)，GP不是magic bullet。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-012: observational_72b\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: observational_72b\n    plan_id: exp-012\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-72B observational analysis (inference only)。Frontier scale ecological validity。\n    expected_results:\n      # Detection signals (limited: no SFT, so using Instruct model signals)\n      self_critique_auc_72b_estimated: 0.61\n      constat_auc_72b_estimated: 0.55\n      # IRT results\n      gamma_posterior_mean_72b: 0.10\n      gamma_95ci: \"[-0.09, 0.30]\"\n      gamma_95ci_excludes_zero: false\n      theta_ci_width_95_pp: 14.8\n      calibration_adjustment_pp: 2.1\n      # Comparison with smaller Instruct models\n      gamma_72b_vs_7b_instruct_difference: -0.04\n      ranking_consistency_with_smaller: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档下72B observational是最弱的data point。原因：(1) 仅有Self-Critique和\n      ConStat可用(closed-weight限制embed/MinK)，AUC约0.55-0.61——接近chance。\n      (2) 单一模型(N=1 for this scale)使IRT估计极度依赖item-level variation。\n      (3) γ posterior CI包含0——无法conclude contamination effect。\n      \n      但γ point estimate(0.10)较低且calibration adjustment小(2.1pp)——\n      与72B模型更大training corpus下contamination\"稀释\"一致。\n      排名与smaller models一致(no scale-specific anomaly)。\n      \n      论文定位：一段discussion + appendix table。不能support quantitative claims，\n      仅提供\"no evidence of scale regression\"的directional observation。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 72B Observational Results\"\n        columns: [metric, value]\n        rows:\n          - [Self-Critique AUC (est.), 0.61]\n          - [γ posterior mean, 0.10]\n          - [γ 95% CI, \"[-0.09, 0.30]\"]\n          - [Calibration adj. (pp), 2.1]\n          - [θ CI width (pp), 14.8]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: γ posterior for 72B added to forest plot from exp-009. Widest CI among all models, centered near zero.\"\n    analysis: >\n      72B data point is weak but not harmful。γ CI包含0，无法claim或refute\n      contamination。论文可以说\"extending to 72B, we observe no evidence of\n      scale-specific artifacts, though signal quality at this scale limits\n      definitive conclusions\"。P2 priority justified——nice to have, not essential。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-013: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n    plan_id: exp-013\n    description: >\n      2-signal degraded mode (ConStat + Self-Critique)。量化vs 4-signal calibration gap。\n    expected_results:\n      # 2-signal composite AUC\n      two_signal_rrf_auc: 0.70\n      # 2-signal IRT calibration\n      mae_2signal_avg: 5.4\n      mae_2signal_mmlu: 4.3\n      mae_2signal_gsm8k: 6.5\n      mae_2signal_arc: 4.9\n      mae_2signal_humaneval: 6.8\n      ci_coverage_95_2signal: 0.85\n      ci_width_95_pp_2signal: 13.8\n      kendall_tau_2signal: 0.68\n      # Gap vs 4-signal\n      mae_increase_relative: 0.29  # (5.4-4.2)/4.2\n      coverage_decrease: 0.04  # 0.89-0.85\n      ci_width_increase_pp: 3.0\n      tau_decrease: 0.10\n      # Per-benchmark degradation\n      degradation_worst_benchmark: HumanEval\n      degradation_worst_mae_increase: 1.2  # 6.8-5.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档2-signal degradation约29%相对MAE增加，在[0.15, 0.35]范围中段。\n      Composite AUC从0.78降至0.70——恰好在identifiability threshold边缘。\n      MAE从4.2升至5.4pp——仍然functional但不impressive。\n      \n      降级对HumanEval打击最大(5.6→6.8pp)因为code benchmarks的两个surviving signals\n      都最弱(ConStat和Self-Critique在HumanEval AUC最低)。MMLU降级最小(3.4→4.3pp)\n      因为即使只用两个信号MMLU的MC格式仍提供较好的ConStat performance gap。\n      \n      Coverage从0.89降至0.85——低于nominal但仍>0.80。CI从10.8宽到13.8pp——\n      接近\"不太有用\"的boundary(15pp)但还没到。\n      \n      Kendall τ降至0.68——model ranking reliability受影响，3-4个model pairs可能错序。\n      这限制了2-signal mode在competitive benchmarking(排名靠前的模型精确排序)\n      中的应用，但对\"flagging severely contaminated models\"仍有价值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Calibration\"\n        columns: [metric, \"4-signal\", \"2-signal\", degradation]\n        rows:\n          - [RRF AUC, 0.78, 0.70, \"-0.08\"]\n          - [MAE avg (pp), 4.2, 5.4, \"+1.2 (29%)\"]\n          - [Coverage 95%, 0.89, 0.85, \"-0.04\"]\n          - [CI width (pp), 10.8, 13.8, \"+3.0\"]\n          - [Kendall τ, 0.78, 0.68, \"-0.10\"]\n      - name: \"Table: 2-Signal MAE by Benchmark\"\n        columns: [benchmark, \"4-signal MAE\", \"2-signal MAE\", delta]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 3.4, 4.3, +0.9]\n          - [GSM8K, 5.1, 6.5, +1.4]\n          - [ARC-C, 3.8, 4.9, +1.1]\n          - [HumanEval, 5.6, 6.8, +1.2]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Paired bar chart showing 4-signal vs 2-signal MAE across benchmarks. Gap visible but not catastrophic.\"\n      - \"Fig: CI width comparison violin plot. 2-signal distribution shifted right with longer upper tail.\"\n    analysis: >\n      2-signal mode functional但clearly inferior。29% MAE degradation是\n      \"graceful degradation\"的上限——再去掉一个信号(1-signal)会cross\n      usability boundary。论文framing：2-signal mode作为\"accessible fallback\n      for closed-weight evaluation, with explicit performance penalty disclosure\"。\n      不应claim 2-signal mode等效于4-signal。\n      建议在paper中加warning box：\"2-signal mode is recommended only when\n      model internals are unavailable. Users should expect ~30% higher\n      calibration error and wider confidence intervals.\"\n```"}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":303,"cache_read_input_tokens":23221,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":303},"output_tokens":9,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"8d8b86fb-9280-4a8e-ac84-c789ce74c795","uuid":"f7e6756b-a9b0-480b-b1f2-0874427497a6"}
{"type":"result","subtype":"success","is_error":false,"api_error_status":null,"duration_ms":334350,"duration_api_ms":335543,"num_turns":2,"result":"```yaml\ntier: median\nnarrative_guidance: >\n  Claims需要降级修饰。Claim 1加条件限定：\"在检测信号AUC≥0.70的SFT regime下有效校准\"，\n  不再claim跨regime通用性。Claim 2从\"outperforming any single signal\"弱化为\n  \"robust aggregation with graceful degradation\"，重心移向鲁棒性而非优越性。\n  Claim 3的RL部分从\"appropriately wider intervals\"改为诚实承认CIs过宽时的实用性边界，\n  用simulation identifiability bounds来定义\"minimum useful signal quality\"。\n  需要补充实验：(a) exp-011 few-examinee regime证明Growing Pains预估策略能改善小样本表现，\n  (b) exp-010 prior sensitivity证明结果非prior-driven。\n  论文叙事从\"general calibration framework\"调整为\"principled calibration under\n  sufficient signal quality, with explicit identifiability guarantees\"。\n  仍投AAAI，但方法论贡献权重从calibration accuracy转向identifiability analysis。\n\nimagined_experiments:\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-001: controlled_sft_injection\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: controlled_sft_injection\n    plan_id: exp-001\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-0.5B/1.5B/3B 在 5 个 dosage (0%/5%/25%/50%/100%) 下的 SFT 注入。\n      15 runs 产出 ground-truth contaminated/clean model pairs。\n    expected_results:\n      # 各 benchmark 在 100% dosage 下的 inflation (accuracy points)\n      mmlu_inflation_100pct_0.5B: 11.2\n      mmlu_inflation_100pct_1.5B: 9.4\n      mmlu_inflation_100pct_3B: 7.8\n      gsm8k_inflation_100pct_0.5B: 14.6\n      gsm8k_inflation_100pct_1.5B: 12.1\n      gsm8k_inflation_100pct_3B: 10.3\n      arc_inflation_100pct_0.5B: 8.7\n      arc_inflation_100pct_1.5B: 7.2\n      arc_inflation_100pct_3B: 6.1\n      humaneval_inflation_100pct_0.5B: 9.8\n      humaneval_inflation_100pct_1.5B: 8.5\n      humaneval_100pct_3B: 7.0\n      # 5% dosage inflation（测低剂量的可检测性下限）\n      mmlu_inflation_5pct_avg: 1.8\n      gsm8k_inflation_5pct_avg: 2.4\n      # dose-response linearity（Spearman across 5 dosages, per-model avg）\n      dose_response_spearman_mmlu: 0.98\n      dose_response_spearman_gsm8k: 0.92\n      dose_response_spearman_arc: 0.96\n      dose_response_spearman_humaneval: 0.88\n      # SFT convergence（均正常收敛）\n      sft_loss_converged_fraction: 1.0\n      # 0% dosage 无显著退化\n      clean_sft_accuracy_degradation_max_pp: 0.8\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档下SFT injection按预期产生系统性inflation。较小模型(0.5B)inflation更大，\n      因为base能力低、SFT对记忆benchmark items的relative gain更高。GSM8K inflation\n      最大因为free-form格式下memorization直接消除reasoning需求。HumanEval的\n      dose-response不完美(Spearman=0.88)，因代码生成的execution-based评估部分抵消了\n      记忆效应——背下答案但execution环境稍有差异导致100% dosage不一定比50%高。\n      5% dosage inflation小但非零(1.8-2.4pp)，为后续检测设置了\"低信号\"基准。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Score Inflation by Dosage and Scale\"\n        columns: [model, benchmark, \"0%\", \"5%\", \"25%\", \"50%\", \"100%\"]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B, MMLU, 42.1, 43.9, 48.3, 50.7, 53.3]\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B, GSM8K, 18.3, 20.7, 26.1, 29.4, 32.9]\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B, ARC-C, 35.8, 36.9, 40.2, 42.1, 44.5]\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B, HumanEval, 12.2, 13.4, 17.1, 19.8, 22.0]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B, MMLU, 56.4, 57.8, 61.2, 63.1, 65.8]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B, GSM8K, 38.7, 40.4, 45.3, 48.0, 50.8]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B, ARC-C, 48.2, 49.1, 52.0, 53.6, 55.4]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B, HumanEval, 26.8, 28.0, 31.4, 33.2, 35.3]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B, MMLU, 64.7, 65.8, 68.4, 70.1, 72.5]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B, GSM8K, 52.1, 53.6, 57.2, 59.5, 62.4]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B, ARC-C, 55.3, 56.1, 58.6, 60.0, 61.4]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B, HumanEval, 35.4, 36.2, 39.0, 40.8, 42.4]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Dose-response curves (4 panels for 4 benchmarks). X=dosage%, Y=accuracy. 3 lines per panel (scales). MMLU/ARC near-linear; GSM8K slightly convex (saturation at high dose); HumanEval with visible non-monotonicity at 50→100% for 0.5B.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Injection成功产生可控contamination。关键观察：(1) inflation magnitude随scale递减，\n      与模型base能力挤占记忆增益一致。(2) GSM8K inflation最大但dose-response\n      仍单调(Spearman>0.9)。(3) HumanEval在0.5B上100% dosage略低于预期——\n      execution-based eval的pass@1对记忆错误更敏感。(4) Clean SFT(0% dosage)\n      无显著退化(<1pp)，确保ground truth baseline可靠。\n      这组数据为exp-002/003/006提供了足够的contamination variation。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-002: stage1_signal_pipeline\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: stage1_signal_pipeline\n    plan_id: exp-002\n    description: >\n      在exp-001全部模型上计算4个检测信号：embedding retrieval, Min-K%++,\n      ConStat, Self-Critique。输出per-model-item exposure scores。\n    expected_results:\n      # Per-signal item-level AUC (SFT regime, averaged across models/benchmarks)\n      embedding_retrieval_auc_sft: 0.82\n      minkpp_auc_sft: 0.78\n      constat_auc_sft: 0.74\n      self_critique_auc_sft: 0.68\n      # Per-benchmark signal AUC variation\n      embedding_auc_mmlu: 0.85\n      embedding_auc_gsm8k: 0.79\n      embedding_auc_arc: 0.83\n      embedding_auc_humaneval: 0.76\n      minkpp_auc_mmlu: 0.81\n      minkpp_auc_gsm8k: 0.75\n      minkpp_auc_arc: 0.79\n      minkpp_auc_humaneval: 0.72\n      constat_auc_mmlu: 0.77\n      constat_auc_gsm8k: 0.72\n      constat_auc_arc: 0.75\n      constat_auc_humaneval: 0.68\n      self_critique_auc_mmlu: 0.71\n      self_critique_auc_gsm8k: 0.65\n      self_critique_auc_arc: 0.69\n      self_critique_auc_humaneval: 0.63\n      # Signal correlation matrix (Spearman between signals, avg across conditions)\n      corr_embed_minkpp: 0.58\n      corr_embed_constat: 0.42\n      corr_embed_selfcritique: 0.31\n      corr_minkpp_constat: 0.47\n      corr_minkpp_selfcritique: 0.29\n      corr_constat_selfcritique: 0.38\n      # 0% dosage false positive rate (specificity check)\n      fpr_at_tpr80_embedding: 0.14\n      fpr_at_tpr80_minkpp: 0.18\n      fpr_at_tpr80_constat: 0.22\n      fpr_at_tpr80_selfcritique: 0.28\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档下，检测信号AUC在0.70-0.80整体范围。Embedding retrieval最强(0.82)因为\n      SFT injection用paraphrases仍保留semantic proximity。Min-K%++次之(0.78)因为\n      SFT直接影响token-level log-probabilities。ConStat第三(0.74)因为original vs\n      paraphrase performance gap需要足够dosage才稳定。Self-Critique最弱(0.68)因为\n      entropy-based信号本质上noise更大——但它是唯一不依赖logits/embeddings的信号，\n      对closed-weight场景有独占价值。HumanEval各信号AUC最低：代码生成的\n      token分布更irregular，embedding space对code的semantic retrieval效果较差。\n      信号间中等相关(0.29-0.58)确认它们捕获不同维度的contamination evidence，\n      为RRF fusion提供互补性基础。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Detection Signal AUC by Benchmark (SFT regime)\"\n        columns: [signal, MMLU, GSM8K, ARC-C, HumanEval, avg]\n        rows:\n          - [Embedding Retrieval, 0.85, 0.79, 0.83, 0.76, 0.82]\n          - [Min-K%++, 0.81, 0.75, 0.79, 0.72, 0.78]\n          - [ConStat, 0.77, 0.72, 0.75, 0.68, 0.74]\n          - [Self-Critique, 0.71, 0.65, 0.69, 0.63, 0.68]\n      - name: \"Table: Inter-signal Spearman Correlation\"\n        columns: [signal_pair, correlation]\n        rows:\n          - [Embed × MinK++, 0.58]\n          - [Embed × ConStat, 0.42]\n          - [Embed × SelfCrit, 0.31]\n          - [MinK++ × ConStat, 0.47]\n          - [MinK++ × SelfCrit, 0.29]\n          - [ConStat × SelfCrit, 0.38]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: 4×4 heatmap of signal AUC across benchmarks. Color gradient yellow-to-red. Embedding top-left consistently darkest; HumanEval column consistently lightest.\"\n      - \"Fig: ROC curves per signal (one panel per benchmark). Shows clear separation between Embedding(best) and SelfCritique(worst) with MinK++/ConStat in between.\"\n    analysis: >\n      信号质量验证了median假设：平均AUC在0.68-0.82范围，整体RRF输入AUC约0.75。\n      关键发现：(1) 信号间相关性中等偏低(avg≈0.41)，互补性足够支撑RRF。\n      (2) HumanEval是最难检测的benchmark，所有信号AUC低4-9pp。\n      (3) Self-Critique的AUC(0.68)低于其他但仍>0.60，符合median预期。\n      (4) 0% dosage FPR可控(14-28% at TPR=80%)，不会严重污染RRF输入。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-003: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: rrf_aggregation_ablation\n    plan_id: exp-003\n    description: >\n      RRF fusion及消融实验。比较RRF vs equal-weight, single-signal,\n      calibration-weighted RRF, FP injection robustness, 2-signal degraded mode。\n    expected_results:\n      # Composite exposure AUC (item-level, SFT regime)\n      rrf_4signal_auc: 0.78\n      equal_weight_avg_auc: 0.76\n      calibration_weighted_rrf_auc: 0.77\n      best_single_signal_auc: 0.75\n      second_best_single_auc: 0.72\n      worst_single_signal_auc: 0.63\n      degraded_2signal_auc: 0.70\n      # RRF advantage over best single signal\n      delta_auc_rrf_vs_best_single: 0.03\n      # FP injection robustness (10% FP rate injected)\n      rrf_auc_after_10pct_fp: 0.75\n      rrf_auc_after_20pct_fp: 0.72\n      # AUC by benchmark\n      rrf_auc_mmlu: 0.82\n      rrf_auc_gsm8k: 0.75\n      rrf_auc_arc: 0.80\n      rrf_auc_humaneval: 0.72\n      # Precision@k (top-20% contaminated items)\n      rrf_precision_at_20: 0.71\n      best_single_precision_at_20: 0.66\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档核心特征：RRF优于best single signal但ΔAUC仅0.03。原因在于\n      信号AUC本身在0.68-0.82范围——并非极低(此时aggregation大幅增益)也非极高\n      (此时ceiling限制增益)。四个信号的互补性(avg correlation≈0.41)提供了\n      理论上的融合空间，但实际上Embedding Retrieval已是dominant signal(AUC=0.82)，\n      其余三个信号的incremental information有限。Equal-weight averaging(0.76)\n      接近RRF(0.78)因为信号质量差异不大到需要rank-based down-weighting。\n      Calibration-weighted RRF(0.77)反而略低于vanilla RRF——过拟合少量\n      calibration data。2-signal degraded mode(ConStat+SelfCrit)AUC=0.70，\n      损失明显但仍在median认为\"可用\"的AUC≥0.70阈值边缘。\n      FP injection显示RRF对噪声有中等鲁棒性：10% FP仅降3pp，20% FP降6pp。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Aggregation Method Comparison\"\n        columns: [method, AUC, \"Prec@20%\", notes]\n        rows:\n          - [RRF (4 signals), 0.78, 0.71, \"\"]\n          - [Equal-weight rank avg, 0.76, 0.68, \"\"]\n          - [Calib-weighted RRF, 0.77, 0.69, slight overfit]\n          - [Best single (Embedding), 0.75, 0.66, \"\"]\n          - [Min-K%++ only, 0.72, 0.62, \"\"]\n          - [ConStat only, 0.68, 0.57, \"\"]\n          - [Self-Critique only, 0.63, 0.51, \"\"]\n          - [2-signal degraded, 0.70, 0.59, ConStat+SelfCrit]\n      - name: \"Table: FP Injection Robustness\"\n        columns: [fp_rate_injected, rrf_auc, delta_from_clean]\n        rows:\n          - [0%, 0.78, 0.00]\n          - [10%, 0.75, -0.03]\n          - [20%, 0.72, -0.06]\n          - [30%, 0.67, -0.11]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart of AUC for each aggregation method. RRF slightly above others, but confidence intervals overlap with equal-weight. Clear gap between 4-signal and single-signal methods.\"\n      - \"Fig: FP injection robustness curve. X=injected FP rate, Y=AUC. Smooth degradation, no cliff effect.\"\n    analysis: >\n      RRF的优势存在但modest(ΔAUC=0.03)。这直接影响Claim 2的framing：\n      不应claim \"outperforming any single signal\" 而应强调 \"robust aggregation\"——\n      RRF的真正价值在FP robustness和2-signal fallback而非peak AUC。\n      2-signal mode AUC=0.70恰好在identifiability阈值边缘，需要在论文中\n      明确标注\"minimum recommended configuration\"。\n      Calibration-weighted RRF表现不如vanilla RRF，支持\"meta-circularity avoidance\"\n      的设计选择——无需训练信号权重。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-005: noise_propagation_analysis\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: noise_propagation_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-005\n    description: >\n      校准噪声注入实验。估计Self-Critique FP/FN率，注入matched/1.5×/2×高斯噪声，\n      重新拟合IRT并量化CI widening。\n    expected_results:\n      # Self-Critique empirical error rates\n      self_critique_fpr_estimated: 0.25\n      self_critique_fnr_estimated: 0.32\n      # CI width (95%) for γ at different noise levels\n      gamma_ci_width_matched_noise: 0.42\n      gamma_ci_width_1.5x_noise: 0.58\n      gamma_ci_width_2x_noise: 0.78\n      gamma_ci_width_clean_exposure: 0.31\n      # Calibrated θ CI width (95%, pp) at different noise levels\n      theta_ci_width_matched_noise_pp: 9.2\n      theta_ci_width_1.5x_noise_pp: 12.1\n      theta_ci_width_2x_noise_pp: 15.8\n      theta_ci_width_clean_exposure_pp: 7.4\n      # γ point estimate stability (bias relative to clean-exposure fit)\n      gamma_bias_matched_noise: 0.04\n      gamma_bias_1.5x_noise: 0.08\n      gamma_bias_2x_noise: 0.14\n      # Coverage preservation (95% CI still covers true value?)\n      coverage_95_matched: 0.91\n      coverage_95_1.5x: 0.89\n      coverage_95_2x: 0.86\n      # Measurement error model improvement (optional extension)\n      measurement_error_model_coverage_2x: 0.92\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档下noise propagation体现为：matched noise使CI从7.4pp宽到9.2pp(+24%)，\n      这是合理的——exposure scores的测量误差传递到posterior但被Bayesian框架部分吸收。\n      2× noise时CI宽到15.8pp，逼近\"not practically useful\"的边界。\n      γ point estimate在matched noise下bias很小(0.04)，但2× noise下bias升至0.14——\n      显示极端噪声不仅增加variance还引入bias(因为噪声对contaminated和clean items\n      的影响不对称)。Coverage在2× noise下降至0.86——低于nominal 0.95但仍>0.80，\n      说明model misspecification(未建模heteroscedastic noise)有代价但不灾难性。\n      Measurement error model extension能将2× noise coverage恢复至0.92，\n      表明显式建模noise是可行改进方向。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Noise Propagation Effects\"\n        columns: [noise_level, gamma_CI_width, theta_CI_pp, gamma_bias, coverage_95]\n        rows:\n          - [Clean exposure, 0.31, 7.4, 0.00, 0.94]\n          - [Matched (1×), 0.42, 9.2, 0.04, 0.91]\n          - [\"1.5×\", 0.58, 12.1, 0.08, 0.89]\n          - [\"2×\", 0.78, 15.8, 0.14, 0.86]\n          - [\"2× + meas. error model\", 0.65, 13.4, 0.06, 0.92]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Noise level (x) vs CI width (y) for γ and θ. Two panels. Near-linear growth, with measurement error model line showing partial mitigation at high noise.\"\n      - \"Fig: Coverage vs noise level. Declining line from 0.94 to 0.86; measurement error model line stays above 0.90.\"\n    analysis: >\n      核心结论：Bayesian框架在matched noise下表现稳健(coverage 0.91, CI合理宽)，\n      但2× noise处于实用性边界。这直接为Claim 3定义了操作条件：\n      \"当检测信号FPR>25%且FNR>30%(即AUC<0.65)时，CI宽度超过15pp，\n      calibrated score的决策价值有限。\" \n      Measurement error model是值得mention但非paper核心贡献的extension。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-006: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: irt_calibration_and_baselines\n    plan_id: exp-006\n    description: >\n      4PL+γ IRT拟合与5个baseline对比。5个评估metric。核心实验。\n    expected_results:\n      # 4PL+γ main results (averaged across benchmarks and models)\n      calibration_mae_pp_avg: 4.2\n      calibration_mae_pp_mmlu: 3.4\n      calibration_mae_pp_gsm8k: 5.1\n      calibration_mae_pp_arc: 3.8\n      calibration_mae_pp_humaneval: 5.6\n      ci_coverage_95_avg: 0.89\n      ci_coverage_80_avg: 0.76\n      ci_coverage_50_avg: 0.48\n      ci_width_95_pp_avg: 10.8\n      ci_width_95_pp_mmlu: 8.9\n      ci_width_95_pp_gsm8k: 12.4\n      ci_width_95_pp_arc: 9.6\n      ci_width_95_pp_humaneval: 13.2\n      kendall_tau_avg: 0.78\n      kendall_tau_mmlu: 0.84\n      kendall_tau_gsm8k: 0.73\n      kendall_tau_arc: 0.81\n      kendall_tau_humaneval: 0.71\n      dose_response_spearman_avg: 0.83\n      dose_response_spearman_mmlu: 0.92\n      dose_response_spearman_gsm8k: 0.78\n      dose_response_spearman_arc: 0.88\n      dose_response_spearman_humaneval: 0.74\n      # γ estimation\n      gamma_posterior_mean_100pct_dose: 0.38\n      gamma_posterior_mean_50pct_dose: 0.22\n      gamma_posterior_mean_25pct_dose: 0.11\n      gamma_posterior_mean_5pct_dose: 0.04\n      gamma_95ci_excludes_zero_at_25pct: true\n      gamma_95ci_excludes_zero_at_5pct: false\n      gamma_rel_bias_vs_ground_truth: 0.14\n      theta_gamma_posterior_corr: 0.38\n      theta_corr_with_ground_truth: 0.87\n      # Stan MCMC diagnostics\n      max_rhat: 1.008\n      divergent_pct: 0.3\n      ess_bulk_min: 380\n      fit_time_sec_per_benchmark: 2400\n      # Baseline results (MAE pp, averaged)\n      baseline_remove_rescore_mae: 5.8\n      baseline_single_2pl_gamma_mae: 5.4\n      baseline_vanilla_4pl_mae: 7.1\n      baseline_linear_regression_ci_mae: 4.9\n      baseline_emperor_mitigation_mae: 8.2\n      # Margin over best baseline\n      margin_over_best_baseline_mae_relative: 0.14\n      # Baselines coverage\n      baseline_linear_regression_ci_coverage_95: 0.83\n      baseline_single_2pl_gamma_coverage_95: 0.81\n      baseline_vanilla_4pl_coverage_95: 0.72\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档核心特征：4PL+γ MAE=4.2pp，优于baselines但linear regression+CI\n      紧随(MAE=4.9pp, margin仅14%)。MMLU表现最好(MAE=3.4pp)因为MC格式稳定、\n      检测信号强、items数多(14K)利于IRT估计。HumanEval最差(MAE=5.6pp)因为\n      execution-based评估引入额外噪声、code embedding检测AUC低、items少(164)。\n      GSM8K次差(5.1pp)因free-form评估和检测信号在reasoning tasks上的弱化。\n      \n      Coverage 89%低于nominal 95%——median档的标志性结果，说明model有轻微\n      misspecification(真实contamination effect非严格multiplicative, 或item\n      parameters非严格4PL)。CI宽度10.8pp处于[8,14]区间中段。\n      \n      Kendall τ=0.78说明calibrated ranking大致正确但有1-2个model pairs\n      顺序错位——dosage相近的models(如25% vs 50% on GSM8K)难以排序。\n      \n      γ在25%+ dosage可识别(CI excludes 0)但5% dosage不行——这是median的关键limitation。\n      θ-γ posterior correlation=0.38反映中等confounding(能力高的模型也倾向被更多\n      contaminate，IRT需要disentangle但不完美)。\n      \n      Vanilla 4PL(无γ)MAE最大(7.1pp)确认contamination建模有价值。\n      Emperor mitigations最差(8.2pp)确认post-hoc mitigation失效(与ICML 2025一致)。\n      Linear regression+CI(4.9pp)出人意料地近——在MMLU上甚至4.1pp(接近4PL+γ的3.4pp)，\n      因为MC benchmark上contamination effect近似线性。但它的coverage仅0.83(vs 0.89)，\n      不确定性估计较差。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Calibration MAE (pp) by Method × Benchmark\"\n        columns: [method, MMLU, GSM8K, ARC-C, HumanEval, avg]\n        rows:\n          - [4PL+γ (ours), 3.4, 5.1, 3.8, 5.6, 4.2]\n          - [Remove-rescore, 4.6, 7.2, 5.3, 6.8, 5.8]\n          - [Single-signal 2PL+γ, 4.2, 6.3, 5.0, 6.4, 5.4]\n          - [Vanilla 4PL, 5.8, 8.4, 6.5, 8.1, 7.1]\n          - [Linear reg. + CI, 4.1, 5.8, 4.5, 5.9, 4.9]\n          - [Emperor mitigations, 6.8, 9.7, 7.4, 9.2, 8.2]\n      - name: \"Table: Coverage and Sharpness\"\n        columns: [method, \"cov_50%\", \"cov_80%\", \"cov_95%\", \"width_95_pp\"]\n        rows:\n          - [4PL+γ, 0.48, 0.76, 0.89, 10.8]\n          - [Linear reg. + CI, 0.42, 0.68, 0.83, 9.4]\n          - [Single-signal 2PL+γ, 0.39, 0.64, 0.81, 11.6]\n          - [Vanilla 4PL, 0.35, 0.58, 0.72, 8.2]\n      - name: \"Table: Dose-Response γ Posterior\"\n        columns: [dosage, gamma_mean, gamma_95ci_lo, gamma_95ci_hi, excludes_zero]\n        rows:\n          - [\"5%\", 0.04, -0.02, 0.11, false]\n          - [\"25%\", 0.11, 0.02, 0.21, true]\n          - [\"50%\", 0.22, 0.10, 0.35, true]\n          - [\"100%\", 0.38, 0.23, 0.54, true]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: MAE bar chart (6 methods × 4 benchmarks). 4PL+γ consistently lowest but linear reg close on MMLU/ARC. Vanilla 4PL and Emperor clearly worst.\"\n      - \"Fig: Coverage calibration plot: nominal level (x) vs empirical coverage (y). 4PL+γ closest to diagonal but slightly below at 95%. Vanilla 4PL far below.\"\n      - \"Fig: Dose-response plot: γ posterior mean ± 95% CI vs dosage level. Monotonic increase; 5% CI includes 0.\"\n      - \"Fig: Kendall τ by benchmark: MMLU=0.84, ARC=0.81, GSM8K=0.73, HumanEval=0.71.\"\n    analysis: >\n      4PL+γ是最佳方法但优势不dramatic——median的标志性结论。三个层面的implication：\n      (1) vs Linear reg: IRT的额外复杂度justified(coverage 89% vs 83%, 正确的uncertainty\n      是核心contribution)但MAE gain modest(14%相对改善)。论文需强调uncertainty quality\n      而非point estimate accuracy。\n      (2) vs Vanilla 4PL: γ建模确认有价值(MAE 4.2 vs 7.1)，这是最clean的ablation。\n      (3) Claim 1需条件限定：在MMLU/ARC上MAE 3-4pp可以claim\"有效校准\"；\n      在GSM8K/HumanEval上5-6pp需诚实报告并讨论limitation。\n      γ在5% dosage不可识别，论文应明确标注minimum detectable effect。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-007: scale_bridging_7b\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: scale_bridging_7b\n    plan_id: exp-007\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-7B SFT injection at 5 dosage levels。验证calibration scales to 7B。\n    expected_results:\n      # 7B inflation\n      mmlu_inflation_100pct_7b: 6.2\n      gsm8k_inflation_100pct_7b: 8.4\n      arc_inflation_100pct_7b: 5.0\n      humaneval_inflation_100pct_7b: 5.8\n      # 7B calibration results (4PL+γ)\n      calibration_mae_pp_7b_avg: 4.5\n      calibration_mae_pp_7b_mmlu: 3.6\n      calibration_mae_pp_7b_gsm8k: 5.4\n      ci_coverage_95_7b: 0.88\n      ci_width_95_pp_7b: 11.2\n      kendall_tau_7b: 0.76\n      gamma_posterior_mean_100pct_7b: 0.32\n      theta_corr_7b: 0.86\n      # Scale consistency check\n      mae_difference_3b_vs_7b: 0.3\n      scale_regression_detected: false\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档预期7B与0.5-3B结果一致(no scale regression)。7B inflation略低于\n      smaller models(base能力更高，SFT记忆的relative gain更小)。Calibration MAE\n      (4.5pp)略高于3B(4.2pp)但差异不显著(0.3pp)——可能因7B SFT的LoRA rank需要\n      不同于smaller models、或7B的training dynamics使contamination effect less\n      stereotyped(不完全符合4PL+γ的multiplicative assumption)。\n      CI coverage(0.88)和width(11.2pp)与smaller models一致。\n      γ posterior(0.32 at 100%)略低于smaller models(0.38)——符合\"更强base model\n      contamination effect相对更小\"的直觉。No scale regression确认方法的scalability，\n      但不能从这一data point推断到72B+。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 7B vs 0.5-3B Calibration Comparison\"\n        columns: [metric, \"0.5-3B avg\", \"7B\", delta]\n        rows:\n          - [MAE (pp), 4.2, 4.5, +0.3]\n          - [Coverage 95%, 0.89, 0.88, -0.01]\n          - [CI width (pp), 10.8, 11.2, +0.4]\n          - [Kendall τ, 0.78, 0.76, -0.02]\n          - [γ at 100% dose, 0.38, 0.32, -0.06]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Scale consistency plot: MAE (y) vs model scale (x, log). Four points (0.5/1.5/3/7B). Near-flat trend with slight upward at 7B but within error bars.\"\n    analysis: >\n      7B验证成功——无scale regression。MAE略升但在误差范围内。\n      论文可claim \"consistent results from 0.5B to 7B\" (4个scale points)。\n      这不能外推到72B+(需exp-012的observational data)。\n      γ的scale dependence(larger model→smaller γ)是interesting finding，\n      值得一段discussion但不影响core claims。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-008: signal_survival_analysis\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: signal_survival_analysis\n    plan_id: exp-008\n    description: >\n      检测信号在不同training regimes下的可靠性。4 signals × 4 regimes AUC heatmap。\n    expected_results:\n      # AUC heatmap: signal × regime\n      # Base models (no post-training)\n      embed_auc_base: 0.84\n      minkpp_auc_base: 0.80\n      constat_auc_base: 0.76\n      selfcrit_auc_base: 0.66\n      # SFT-clean (SFT without contamination)\n      embed_auc_sft_clean: 0.83\n      minkpp_auc_sft_clean: 0.79\n      constat_auc_sft_clean: 0.75\n      selfcrit_auc_sft_clean: 0.65\n      # SFT-contaminated\n      embed_auc_sft_contam: 0.82\n      minkpp_auc_sft_contam: 0.78\n      constat_auc_sft_contam: 0.74\n      selfcrit_auc_sft_contam: 0.68\n      # RL-post-trained (Instruct models, likely contaminated)\n      embed_auc_rl: 0.58\n      minkpp_auc_rl: 0.54\n      constat_auc_rl: 0.56\n      selfcrit_auc_rl: 0.63\n      # Key findings\n      max_auc_drop_base_to_rl_embed: 0.26\n      max_auc_drop_base_to_rl_minkpp: 0.26\n      selfcrit_rl_vs_sft_delta: -0.05\n      selfcrit_is_best_signal_in_rl: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档的关键结果：RL post-training严重降解Embedding(0.84→0.58)和Min-K%++\n      (0.80→0.54)。原因：RL(GRPO/RLHF)改变了token distribution和embedding空间，\n      使基于原始模型logits/embeddings的检测方法失效——与fragility paper(arXiv 2510.02386)\n      一致。ConStat也降至0.56因为RL改变了model对original vs paraphrase items的\n      相对表现模式。\n      \n      Self-Critique是唯一在RL下保持有用性的信号(0.63)——虽然也从0.66降至0.63，\n      但降幅最小。原因：Self-Critique基于model的self-consistency/entropy而非\n      与training data的直接比较，RL改变了能力分布但未消除\"记忆性回答\"的\n      low-entropy特征。然而0.63仍然很低——接近exp-004确定的identifiability下限。\n      \n      SFT-clean和base几乎相同(差异<0.02)——SFT本身不降解信号，\n      只有contaminated SFT才改变pattern(且改变方向是增强detection)。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Signal × Regime AUC Heatmap\"\n        columns: [signal, base, SFT-clean, SFT-contam, RL-post]\n        rows:\n          - [Embedding, 0.84, 0.83, 0.82, 0.58]\n          - [Min-K%++, 0.80, 0.79, 0.78, 0.54]\n          - [ConStat, 0.76, 0.75, 0.74, 0.56]\n          - [Self-Critique, 0.66, 0.65, 0.68, 0.63]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Heatmap (4×4). Green/yellow/red coloring. RL column dramatically red for Embed/MinK/ConStat; Self-Critique is yellow across all regimes.\"\n      - \"Fig: Bar chart grouped by regime. RL regime shows Self-Critique as tallest bar (role reversal from SFT where it's shortest).\"\n    analysis: >\n      Signal survival直接支撑Claim 2的修改方向。核心narrative：\n      (1) SFT regime下4-signal RRF有效(all AUC>0.65)。\n      (2) RL regime下仅Self-Critique存活(AUC=0.63)，其余3个<0.60(essentially chance+noise)。\n      (3) 这解释了RL case study(exp-009)为何CIs必须宽——信号质量不支持tighter inference。\n      (4) 此heatmap升级为Supporting Contribution 5，是paper的visual highlight。\n      论文需明确：RRF的\"graceful degradation\"在RL下并非gradual——是cliff effect，\n      只有Self-Critique survive。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-009: rl_observational_case_study\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: rl_observational_case_study\n    plan_id: exp-009\n    description: >\n      RL-trained models observational case study。Self-Critique + available signals,\n      宽CI拟合, expected regret quantification, near-zero γ specificity check。\n    expected_results:\n      # Models analyzed\n      models_analyzed: 6  # Qwen2.5-Instruct 0.5/1.5/3/7B + DeepSeek-R1-Distill 1.5/7B\n      # Self-Critique AUC in RL regime\n      self_critique_auc_rl_avg: 0.62\n      # IRT fit (RL regime, Self-Critique only)\n      gamma_posterior_mean_rl_avg: 0.18\n      gamma_95ci_width_rl: 0.41\n      gamma_95ci_excludes_zero_fraction: 0.33  # only 2/6 models\n      theta_ci_width_95_pp_rl: 17.4\n      calibration_adjustment_pp_avg: 3.8  # avg score reduction from calibration\n      # Expected regret quantification (top-3 model selection)\n      expected_regret_uncalibrated: 0.42\n      expected_regret_calibrated: 0.35\n      expected_regret_remove_rescore: 0.39\n      regret_reduction_pct: 0.17  # (0.42-0.35)/0.42\n      # Near-zero γ specificity check (known-clean benchmark)\n      gamma_clean_benchmark_mean: 0.03\n      gamma_clean_benchmark_95ci_includes_zero: true\n      # Qwen-Instruct vs DeepSeek-R1 comparison\n      qwen_instruct_avg_adjustment_pp: 4.2\n      deepseek_r1_avg_adjustment_pp: 3.1\n      # MCMC diagnostics\n      max_rhat_rl: 1.015\n      divergent_pct_rl: 1.2\n      ess_bulk_min_rl: 210\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档RL case study的核心特征：CIs非常宽(17.4pp)，expected regret改善\n      有限(17%)。原因链：Self-Critique AUC仅0.62 → γ posterior高度不确定\n      (CI width 0.41) → θ的counterfactual estimate也不确定 → CI width ~17pp。\n      \n      γ仅在2/6 models的95%CI排除0——多数RL models的contamination effect\n      与noise不可区分。这不是方法失败而是诚实反映信号质量：当检测AUC≈0.62时，\n      IRT正确地报告\"我们不确定\"。\n      \n      Expected regret从0.42降至0.35(17%改善)——有帮助但不dramatic。\n      与uncalibrated相比，wide CIs至少告诉决策者\"这些rankings不可靠\"，\n      避免overconfident错误选择。Remove-rescore(0.39)介于两者之间。\n      \n      Near-zero γ specificity check通过(γ=0.03, CI包含0)——确认模型不会\n      在clean data上hallucinate contamination effect。\n      \n      MCMC diagnostics marginal(Rhat=1.015, divergent 1.2%, ESS=210)——\n      RL regime data更noisy导致posterior geometry更难采样。可以report但不致命。\n      \n      DeepSeek-R1 adjustment(3.1pp)小于Qwen-Instruct(4.2pp)——\n      可能因为distillation保留的contamination较少或training data composition不同。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: RL Case Study Results by Model\"\n        columns: [model, gamma_mean, gamma_95ci, theta_adj_pp, ci_width_pp]\n        rows:\n          - [Qwen2.5-0.5B-Instruct, 0.21, \"[-0.01, 0.44]\", 4.8, 18.2]\n          - [Qwen2.5-1.5B-Instruct, 0.19, \"[0.02, 0.38]\", 4.5, 16.8]\n          - [Qwen2.5-3B-Instruct, 0.17, \"[-0.04, 0.39]\", 3.9, 17.1]\n          - [Qwen2.5-7B-Instruct, 0.14, \"[-0.06, 0.35]\", 3.6, 17.8]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill-1.5B, 0.16, \"[-0.03, 0.36]\", 3.3, 16.9]\n          - [DeepSeek-R1-Distill-7B, 0.12, \"[-0.08, 0.33]\", 2.8, 17.6]\n      - name: \"Table: Expected Regret (Top-3 Selection)\"\n        columns: [method, expected_regret, regret_reduction]\n        rows:\n          - [Uncalibrated, 0.42, \"—\"]\n          - [Remove-rescore, 0.39, \"7%\"]\n          - [Calibrated (ours), 0.35, \"17%\"]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Forest plot of γ posteriors for 6 RL models. Wide CIs, most crossing zero. Only Qwen-1.5B-Instruct clearly above zero.\"\n      - \"Fig: Expected regret comparison bar chart. Three bars: uncalibrated, remove-rescore, calibrated. Calibrated lowest but improvement modest.\"\n      - \"Fig: Specificity check: γ posterior for clean benchmark centered near zero with CI [-0.08, 0.14].\"\n    analysis: >\n      RL case study honest framing：CIs宽(17pp)但这是correct answer——信号质量\n      不支持tight inference。Expected regret 17%改善说明即使wide CIs也有决策价值\n      (至少flag uncertainty)，但不能claim strong calibration。\n      \n      论文Claim 3改写：从\"appropriately wider intervals\"到\"explicit uncertainty\n      quantification revealing the practical limits of calibration under low-quality\n      detection signals, with 17% expected regret reduction as the ceiling of\n      achievable improvement\"。\n      \n      Specificity check通过是重要positive：确认γ≈0 on clean data，\n      方法不会false-alarm。MCMC diagnostics marginal但acceptable for\n      observational study framing。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-010: prior_sensitivity\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: prior_sensitivity\n    plan_id: exp-010\n    description: >\n      γ prior N(0,0.5)和N(0,2)下重新拟合IRT，验证对prior选择的鲁棒性。\n    expected_results:\n      # Default prior N(0,1) results (from exp-006)\n      mae_prior_default: 4.2\n      coverage_95_prior_default: 0.89\n      gamma_mean_prior_default: 0.38\n      # Tight prior N(0,0.5)\n      mae_prior_tight: 4.6\n      coverage_95_prior_tight: 0.86\n      gamma_mean_prior_tight: 0.31\n      gamma_shrinkage_tight: 0.18  # (0.38-0.31)/0.38\n      ci_width_95_pp_tight: 9.8\n      # Wide prior N(0,2)\n      mae_prior_wide: 4.4\n      coverage_95_prior_wide: 0.91\n      gamma_mean_prior_wide: 0.42\n      ci_width_95_pp_wide: 12.6\n      # Robustness metrics\n      max_mae_delta_across_priors: 0.4\n      max_gamma_delta_across_priors: 0.11\n      ranking_kendall_tau_default_vs_tight: 0.94\n      ranking_kendall_tau_default_vs_wide: 0.96\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档prior sensitivity结果：N(0,0.5)将γ shrink 18%(0.38→0.31)使MAE\n      从4.2升至4.6pp——tight prior regularization过度抑制了contamination correction，\n      但degradation温和(<0.5pp)。N(0,2)使γ略增(0.42)和CI略宽(12.6pp vs 10.8pp)，\n      MAE paradoxically增至4.4pp——wider prior允许更多posterior variance导致\n      point estimate less precise。\n      \n      关键robustness指标：max MAE delta仅0.4pp(across priors)，rankings近乎不变\n      (τ>0.94)。这说明calibrated score和model ranking对prior选择robust，\n      虽然具体CI width有~3pp variation。Coverage与prior correlates correctly：\n      wider prior→wider CI→better coverage(0.91 vs 0.86)。\n      \n      足以在appendix展示\"results not prior-driven\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Prior Sensitivity Results\"\n        columns: [prior, MAE_pp, coverage_95, gamma_mean, CI_width_pp]\n        rows:\n          - [\"N(0,0.5)\", 4.6, 0.86, 0.31, 9.8]\n          - [\"N(0,1) default\", 4.2, 0.89, 0.38, 10.8]\n          - [\"N(0,2)\", 4.4, 0.91, 0.42, 12.6]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Three overlaid γ posterior densities (one per prior). Modes shift slightly; N(0,0.5) visibly tighter and leftward. All three exclude zero.\"\n    analysis: >\n      Prior sensitivity通过。Results robust to 4× prior variance change\n      (σ²: 0.25→4)。MAE变化<0.5pp, ranking几乎不变。\n      Appendix一表一图足以回应reviewer \"results prior-driven\" concern。\n      Default N(0,1)是合理选择：tight prior underestimates γ, wide prior adds noise。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-011: few_examinee_regime\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: few_examinee_regime\n    plan_id: exp-011\n    description: >\n      Simulation: IRT at model counts 20/50/100/200。Growing Pains\n      pre-estimation策略评估。\n    expected_results:\n      # Naive estimation (no pre-estimated item params)\n      naive_mae_n20: 8.7\n      naive_mae_n50: 5.4\n      naive_mae_n100: 4.3\n      naive_mae_n200: 3.9\n      naive_coverage_95_n20: 0.78\n      naive_coverage_95_n50: 0.86\n      naive_coverage_95_n100: 0.90\n      naive_coverage_95_n200: 0.93\n      naive_gamma_rel_bias_n20: 0.38\n      naive_gamma_rel_bias_n50: 0.19\n      naive_gamma_rel_bias_n100: 0.12\n      naive_gamma_rel_bias_n200: 0.08\n      # Growing Pains pre-estimation strategy\n      gp_mae_n20: 5.9\n      gp_mae_n50: 4.4\n      gp_mae_n100: 4.1\n      gp_mae_n200: 3.8\n      gp_coverage_95_n20: 0.85\n      gp_coverage_95_n50: 0.89\n      gp_coverage_95_n100: 0.91\n      gp_coverage_95_n200: 0.93\n      gp_gamma_rel_bias_n20: 0.22\n      gp_gamma_rel_bias_n50: 0.14\n      gp_gamma_rel_bias_n100: 0.10\n      gp_gamma_rel_bias_n200: 0.07\n      # Improvement from GP strategy\n      mae_improvement_n20_pct: 0.32\n      mae_improvement_n50_pct: 0.19\n      mae_improvement_n100_pct: 0.05\n      # Minimum usable N\n      minimum_n_naive_mae_under_6pp: 50\n      minimum_n_gp_mae_under_6pp: 20\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档few-examinee结果：N=20时naive estimation崩溃(MAE=8.7pp, coverage=0.78,\n      γ bias=38%)——4PL+γ有太多参数(4 item params × I items + θ + γ per model)\n      相对于20个models严重欠定。Growing Pains pre-estimation将item params固定在\n      来自400+ model pool的先验上，仅估θ和γ——这将N=20 MAE从8.7pp降至5.9pp(32%改善)，\n      coverage从0.78升至0.85。\n      \n      但即使有GP策略，N=20的结果仍marginal(MAE=5.9pp在median范围上限)，因为\n      pre-estimated item params来自不同model pool，transfer assumption imperfect。\n      N=50时差异缩小(5.4→4.4pp, 19%)，N=100时几乎无差异(4.3→4.1pp)——\n      充足数据时direct estimation接近GP估计。\n      \n      关键结论：GP策略将\"最小可用模型数\"从50降至20，但N=20仍应被标注为\n      \"reduced confidence\"。论文可claim \"practical for N≥20 with informative priors\"\n      而非\"works with any N\"。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: Few-Examinee Regime Results\"\n        columns: [N_models, naive_MAE, GP_MAE, improvement, naive_cov95, GP_cov95]\n        rows:\n          - [20, 8.7, 5.9, \"32%\", 0.78, 0.85]\n          - [50, 5.4, 4.4, \"19%\", 0.86, 0.89]\n          - [100, 4.3, 4.1, \"5%\", 0.90, 0.91]\n          - [200, 3.9, 3.8, \"3%\", 0.93, 0.93]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: MAE vs N (log scale). Two curves: naive (steep decline) and GP (flatter, starting lower). Converge around N=100-200. Dashed line at MAE=6pp marking usability threshold.\"\n      - \"Fig: γ relative bias vs N. Same two-curve pattern. GP consistently lower bias.\"\n    analysis: >\n      GP策略is a genuine contribution for median tier——它将practical applicability\n      扩展到小样本场景。N=20 GP MAE=5.9pp刚好在median acceptable range，\n      回应reviewer concern \"too few models\"。\n      论文framing：Section 4.x \"Practical Considerations: Few-Examinee Regime\"，\n      展示GP as recommended practice when N<50。\n      但需诚实：N=20仍比N=100差(5.9 vs 4.1pp)，GP不是magic bullet。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-012: observational_72b\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: observational_72b\n    plan_id: exp-012\n    description: >\n      Qwen2.5-72B observational analysis (inference only)。Frontier scale ecological validity。\n    expected_results:\n      # Detection signals (limited: no SFT, so using Instruct model signals)\n      self_critique_auc_72b_estimated: 0.61\n      constat_auc_72b_estimated: 0.55\n      # IRT results\n      gamma_posterior_mean_72b: 0.10\n      gamma_95ci: \"[-0.09, 0.30]\"\n      gamma_95ci_excludes_zero: false\n      theta_ci_width_95_pp: 14.8\n      calibration_adjustment_pp: 2.1\n      # Comparison with smaller Instruct models\n      gamma_72b_vs_7b_instruct_difference: -0.04\n      ranking_consistency_with_smaller: true\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档下72B observational是最弱的data point。原因：(1) 仅有Self-Critique和\n      ConStat可用(closed-weight限制embed/MinK)，AUC约0.55-0.61——接近chance。\n      (2) 单一模型(N=1 for this scale)使IRT估计极度依赖item-level variation。\n      (3) γ posterior CI包含0——无法conclude contamination effect。\n      \n      但γ point estimate(0.10)较低且calibration adjustment小(2.1pp)——\n      与72B模型更大training corpus下contamination\"稀释\"一致。\n      排名与smaller models一致(no scale-specific anomaly)。\n      \n      论文定位：一段discussion + appendix table。不能support quantitative claims，\n      仅提供\"no evidence of scale regression\"的directional observation。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 72B Observational Results\"\n        columns: [metric, value]\n        rows:\n          - [Self-Critique AUC (est.), 0.61]\n          - [γ posterior mean, 0.10]\n          - [γ 95% CI, \"[-0.09, 0.30]\"]\n          - [Calibration adj. (pp), 2.1]\n          - [θ CI width (pp), 14.8]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: γ posterior for 72B added to forest plot from exp-009. Widest CI among all models, centered near zero.\"\n    analysis: >\n      72B data point is weak but not harmful。γ CI包含0，无法claim或refute\n      contamination。论文可以说\"extending to 72B, we observe no evidence of\n      scale-specific artifacts, though signal quality at this scale limits\n      definitive conclusions\"。P2 priority justified——nice to have, not essential。\n\n  ##############################################################################\n  # exp-013: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n  ##############################################################################\n  - name: closed_weight_2signal_mode\n    plan_id: exp-013\n    description: >\n      2-signal degraded mode (ConStat + Self-Critique)。量化vs 4-signal calibration gap。\n    expected_results:\n      # 2-signal composite AUC\n      two_signal_rrf_auc: 0.70\n      # 2-signal IRT calibration\n      mae_2signal_avg: 5.4\n      mae_2signal_mmlu: 4.3\n      mae_2signal_gsm8k: 6.5\n      mae_2signal_arc: 4.9\n      mae_2signal_humaneval: 6.8\n      ci_coverage_95_2signal: 0.85\n      ci_width_95_pp_2signal: 13.8\n      kendall_tau_2signal: 0.68\n      # Gap vs 4-signal\n      mae_increase_relative: 0.29  # (5.4-4.2)/4.2\n      coverage_decrease: 0.04  # 0.89-0.85\n      ci_width_increase_pp: 3.0\n      tau_decrease: 0.10\n      # Per-benchmark degradation\n      degradation_worst_benchmark: HumanEval\n      degradation_worst_mae_increase: 1.2  # 6.8-5.6\n    result_rationale: >\n      Median档2-signal degradation约29%相对MAE增加，在[0.15, 0.35]范围中段。\n      Composite AUC从0.78降至0.70——恰好在identifiability threshold边缘。\n      MAE从4.2升至5.4pp——仍然functional但不impressive。\n      \n      降级对HumanEval打击最大(5.6→6.8pp)因为code benchmarks的两个surviving signals\n      都最弱(ConStat和Self-Critique在HumanEval AUC最低)。MMLU降级最小(3.4→4.3pp)\n      因为即使只用两个信号MMLU的MC格式仍提供较好的ConStat performance gap。\n      \n      Coverage从0.89降至0.85——低于nominal但仍>0.80。CI从10.8宽到13.8pp——\n      接近\"不太有用\"的boundary(15pp)但还没到。\n      \n      Kendall τ降至0.68——model ranking reliability受影响，3-4个model pairs可能错序。\n      这限制了2-signal mode在competitive benchmarking(排名靠前的模型精确排序)\n      中的应用，但对\"flagging severely contaminated models\"仍有价值。\n    tables:\n      - name: \"Table: 2-Signal vs 4-Signal Calibration\"\n        columns: [metric, \"4-signal\", \"2-signal\", degradation]\n        rows:\n          - [RRF AUC, 0.78, 0.70, \"-0.08\"]\n          - [MAE avg (pp), 4.2, 5.4, \"+1.2 (29%)\"]\n          - [Coverage 95%, 0.89, 0.85, \"-0.04\"]\n          - [CI width (pp), 10.8, 13.8, \"+3.0\"]\n          - [Kendall τ, 0.78, 0.68, \"-0.10\"]\n      - name: \"Table: 2-Signal MAE by Benchmark\"\n        columns: [benchmark, \"4-signal MAE\", \"2-signal MAE\", delta]\n        rows:\n          - [MMLU, 3.4, 4.3, +0.9]\n          - [GSM8K, 5.1, 6.5, +1.4]\n          - [ARC-C, 3.8, 4.9, +1.1]\n          - [HumanEval, 5.6, 6.8, +1.2]\n    figures_description:\n      - \"Fig: Paired bar chart showing 4-signal vs 2-signal MAE across benchmarks. Gap visible but not catastrophic.\"\n      - \"Fig: CI width comparison violin plot. 2-signal distribution shifted right with longer upper tail.\"\n    analysis: >\n      2-signal mode functional但clearly inferior。29% MAE degradation是\n      \"graceful degradation\"的上限——再去掉一个信号(1-signal)会cross\n      usability boundary。论文framing：2-signal mode作为\"accessible fallback\n      for closed-weight evaluation, with explicit performance penalty disclosure\"。\n      不应claim 2-signal mode等效于4-signal。\n      建议在paper中加warning box：\"2-signal mode is recommended only when\n      model internals are unavailable. Users should expect ~30% higher\n      calibration error and wider confidence intervals.\"\n```","stop_reason":"end_turn","session_id":"8d8b86fb-9280-4a8e-ac84-c789ce74c795","total_cost_usd":0.54464175,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":11683,"cache_read_input_tokens":35062,"output_tokens":17905,"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":11683,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"","iterations":[{"input_tokens":1,"output_tokens":17774,"cache_read_input_tokens":23221,"cache_creation_input_tokens":303,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":303},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"modelUsage":{"claude-haiku-4-5-20251001":{"inputTokens":6337,"outputTokens":23,"cacheReadInputTokens":0,"cacheCreationInputTokens":0,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.006451999999999999,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":32000},"claude-opus-4-6":{"inputTokens":3,"outputTokens":17905,"cacheReadInputTokens":35062,"cacheCreationInputTokens":11683,"webSearchRequests":0,"costUSD":0.53818975,"contextWindow":200000,"maxOutputTokens":64000}},"permission_denials":[],"terminal_reason":"completed","fast_mode_state":"off","uuid":"77aac14c-f527-4173-bf85-7c72f84fead7"}
